==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:The Search for Golmie Greasebeard]] in order to do [[Quest:Friend or Foe:The Savage]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Dorn Geargrinder]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Try to convince the Sandscale to aid the Freewheelers.
*Talk to Headmaster Merk
*Talk to Peace-guana Joe
*Defeat Skullz in Sandscale Territory - /10
*Return to Peace-guana Joe
*Return to Headmaster Merk
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Dorn Geargrinder]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"There're too many <font color='#D9781A'>Skullz</font> for us to face in a straight fight. It also doesn’t help that they're using Gloam artifacts.<br /><br />If we’re going to save Golmie we’ll need one crazy plan. Fortunately <font color='#D9781A'>Headmaster Merk</font> is one of those thinking types, I’m sure he’ll have a few useful ideas." -Dorn Geargrinder
#Speak with [[Headmaster Merk]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Dorn shows his wisdom as a leader by not rushing in blindly to save his friend.<br />From the little time I have spent in Rumble Ridge, one thing is apparent... no one likes the Skullz. I wonder if we could get the Sandscale Manguanas to help out." -Headmaster Merk
#Speak with [[Peace-guana Joe]] located in [[Sandscale Territory]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Those Skullz are a major bummer, man. They've like totally harshed the balance of nature.<br />Put some of the feng shui back into the Valley by getting rid of some of those Skullz and we'll like totally help you out, man. Peace!" -Peace-guana Joe
#Defeat [[Skullz Thug]]s - /10
#*The [[Skullz Thug]]s are located all around the [[Mystical Barrier]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#Speak with [[Peace-guana Joe]] located in [[Sandscale Territory]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Groovy! Those Skullz are like totally bummed now, thanks to you. We'll for sure help you get your friend back, man." -Peace-guana Joe
#Speak with [[Headmaster Merk]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Things must be worse than I imagined if you were able to sway the Manguanas to our cause. Good job! Their help will be invaluable.-Headmaster Merk
